  "description": "Discover the new ITM wheels The integrated full carbon ONE RR handlebar, designed for the Pro Road Racing world, comes standard on all setups.The stem and handlebar are integrated into a single structure that guarantees maximum cable integration, with a clear advantage in terms of rigidity, comfort and world-class aerodynamics.Weight 430 grams.AVAILABLE SIZES40CC x 90 – 100 42CC x 90 – 100 – 110 – 120 44CC x 110 – 120\n\nDiscover the new ITM wheels. Discover more on the ITM wheels, developped exclusively for Bottecchia. SCOPRI DI PIU'\n\nREPARTO CORSE TECHNOLOGIES AEROSPACE is the ultra-fast road carbon aerobike with disc brakes and Internal Routing Cables technology with cables totally integrated into the frame. The total absence of external cables maximizes aerodynamic efficiency and enhances the elegance and precision of the design. Compatible with all mechanical and electronic groupsets, Aerospace combines our best aerodynamic frame with quality components thanks to the most modern technologies that allow for high performance. Designed by RedLab and tested by professional athletes, it guarantees a high-level riding experience. IDEAL FOR Perfect for solo escapes and sprints to the finish line, this extraordinary bike is even faster on flats and up hills. Ideal for who's looking for a fast and aero bike. PERFECT FOR YOU IF It is the best choice for road riders looking for an aerodynamic, fast and high-performance road bike with the safety of disc brakes, perfect in all conditions.",
